# flywheel-health-report 部署清单
# 源:  scripts/flywheel-health-report/
# 标:  /root/.hermes/scripts/flywheel-health-report/
# 影响: cron 触发的飞轮健康报告生成 + 参数自优化调优器；无需重启服务
# 注意: 旧版文件 auto-tuner.py/sh 和 flywheel-health-report.py 部署时自动清理
#
# 语法: 每行一个 glob 模式（相对项目根）；以 ! 开头为排除；# 起始为注释。

# === Include ===
src/flywheel_health_report/**/*.py
scripts/**/*.sh
pyproject.toml

# === Exclude ===
!**/__pycache__/**
!**/*.pyc
!**/.pytest_cache/**
!**/tests/**
!**/test_*.py